        "text": "theorem density_integral {a b : ℝ} (hab : a < b) (ell : S → ℝ) (s : S)\n    (hl : 0 < ell s) (Y : PressureStream.Plane) :\n    (∫ r, density a b hab ell (r, (s, Y))) = 1"
